3. Logos, wordmarks, and brand name (All rights reserved)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Files under `logos/` and the names "Barcelona Bitcoin Hub", "BBH", and the
logo marks are the property of the project founders.

Permitted uses, without prior permission:
  - Referring to Barcelona Bitcoin Hub editorially (in news articles, blog
    posts, academic papers, podcasts).
  - Linking to or embedding the logo when quoting a BBH event or speaker.
  - Collaborating with BBH as a partner, speaker, or attendee, where the logo
    appears alongside the partnership in context.

Prohibited uses:
  - Modifying the logo marks (rotating, skewing, recolouring, insetting text
    or images, removing the orange accent, etc.).
  - Implying endorsement, affiliation, or partnership where none exists.
  - Using the BBH name or logo on material that violates the Solo Bitcoin
    rule (no price, no trading, no altcoins).
  - Selling merchandise featuring the BBH logo without written permission.

For any use not covered above, contact barcelona_btc_hub@proton.me.

